rd and strengthen your skills."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-26T04:14:06.554Z","outOfEra":false}
Ortallius' Cutthroat Rings	29	{"kind":"quest","title":"Ortallius' Cutthroat Rings","wikiPath":"/Ortallius'_Cutthroat_Rings","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Southern Desert of Ro","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Ortallius","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Faction, Experience, Small Coin"}],"card":{"title":"Ortallius' Cutthroat Rings","lines":["Minimum Level: 7","Classes: All","Related Zones: Oasis of Marr, Northern Desert of Ro","Related NPCs: a Dervish Cutthroat, a Dervish Thug"]},"links":["Southern Desert of Ro","Ortallius","Oasis of Marr","Northern Desert of Ro","A Dervish Cutthroat","A Dervish Thug","Faction","Cutthroat Insignia Ring","Temple Of Sol Ro","Shadowed Men"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Ortallius","text":"Welcome to the lands of Ro. Stand and fight with me. We shall fight to reclaim the desert in the name of Solusek Ro. Death to all [dervish cutthroats]!!"},{"npc":"Ortallius","text":"The dervish cutthroats are the vile scum who inhabit the desert. They are rogues who assault wayward travelers. Solusek Ro has commanded their extermination!! Do you wish to [join the crusade]?"},{"npc":"Ortallius","text":"You will make a fine addition to the crusade. Continue the cleansing of the desert. Let it be known that the Defenders of Ro are here to challenge the evils of the desert. I call upon the righteousness of all paladins to assist me."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-26T04:14:07.652Z","outOfEra":false}
Peacekeeper Staff Quest	29	{"kind":"quest","title":"Peacekeeper Staff Quest","wikiPath":"/Peacekeeper_Staff_Quest","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Erudin","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Lumi Stergnon","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Peacekeeper Staff","item":"Peacekeeper Staff","wikiPath":"/Peacekeeper_Staff"}],"steps":[{"parts":["Hand him the letter."],"steps":[{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Merchants of Erudin"}," has been adjusted by 5."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"High Council of Erudin"}," has been adjusted by 5?"],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"High Guard of Erudin"}," has been adjusted by 5?"],"steps":[]}]},{"parts":["You receive a Peacekeeper Staff, a 2-slot container."],"steps":[{"parts":[{"title":"Pearl of Odus"}," are found as ground spawns underwater in the harbor of Erudin at (-275, -460); (-215, -475); and (+5, -485)."],"steps":[]}]},{"parts":["Each Pearl looks like a bag on the ground and is guarded by ",{"title":"A sand shark"}," that is about level 8. None of the KoS sharks in the water see invisibility."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Pearls can be collected before you make the trip to Qeynos to The Cobbler."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Merchants of Qeynos"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Circle Of Unseen Hands"}," got worse."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Antonius Bayle"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Coalition of Tradefolk"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Guards of Qeynos"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["You receive Wooden Shards. Return to Emil Parsini and hand it to him."],"steps":[{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Merchants of Erudin"}," has been adjusted by 5."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"High Council of Erudin"}," has been adjusted by 5."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"High Guard of Erudin"}," has been adjusted by 5."],"steps":[]}]},{"parts":["You receive Treant Resin. Combine the resin and a Pearl of Odus in the Peacekeeper Staff container to craft a non-container Peacekeeper Staff. You can return to Lumi Stergnon and hand this in for faction, some XP, some coin and a rusty weapon, or simply use the Staff."],"steps":[{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Peace Keepers"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"High Council of Erudin"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Heretics"}," got worse."],"steps":[]}]}],"card":{"title":"Peacekeeper Staff Quest","lines":["Minimum Level: 10+","Classes: Cleric, Paladin","Related Zones: Toxxulia Forest, North Qeynos","Related NPCs: Emil Parsini","Faction note: You say, 'I will retrieve the Peacekeeper staffs.' (You must have high Amiable faction with the PeaceKeepers to get this part)"]},"links":["Erudin","Lumi Stergnon","Cleric","Paladin","Toxxulia Forest","Qeynos","Emil Parsini","Peacekeeper Staff","Merchants of Erudin","High Council of Erudin","High Guard of Erudin","Pearl of Odus","A sand shark","Gerault Takenmaul","Rodgar the Tall","Merchants of Qeynos","Circle Of Unseen Hands","Antonius Bayle","Coalition of Tradefolk","Guards of Qeynos","Wooden Shards","Peace Keepers","Heretics","Patchwork Armor"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Lumi Stergnon","text":"Peace and tranquility be with you. ______. Are you a [new acolyte of peace] or are you [here to pay homage] to the child of tranquility?"},{"npc":"Lumi Stergnon","text":"Then you shall learn the ways of Quellious and learn to do as you are told by higher ranking members. It is time for you to do the lesser duties of a young priest. Which will it be? [Retrieve the Peacekeeper staffs] or [battle the undead]?"},{"npc":"Lumi Stergnon","text":"Then take this note to the woodworker in Toxxulia Forest. His name is Emil Parsinsi. He shall have the staff to be returned to the temple."},{"npc":"Emil Parsini","text":"Good to meet you, ______. Please look around. I have much to offer. I am a master woodworker. It runs in the Parsini family."},{"npc":"Emil Parsini","text":"I have been waiting for someone to come and retrieve this staff. Here you are. You will have to combine it with treant resin and an Odus pearl. You can find Odus pearls in the water in the harbor. As for the resin, I can make it if you can find me some treant shards. Maybe another woodworker or cobbler in Qeynos has some."},{"npc":"Gerault Takenmaul","text":"Hello. Please feel free to browse. We make the finest boots in all of Antonica."},{"npc":"Gerault Takenmaul","text":"Looking for Treant material? I do not work with such material. Ask Rodgar. I believe he is upstairs."},{"npc":"Rodgar the Tall","text":"Greetings, ______! You look like you could use some new footwear."},{"npc":"Rodgar the Tall","text":"What is all this talk of Treant Wood? I can get you some. In about two months, I shall have a new stock. Perhaps I may have some to trade... if you do me a [favor]..."},{"npc":"Rodgar the Tall","text":"I will be glad to part with some Treant Wood for an Odus Pearl from the waters surrounding Erudin. On second thought... make that four Odus Pearls."},{"npc":"Rodgar the Tall","text":"Wonderful!! I am sure that was a lot safer than battling a treant."},{"npc":"Emil Parsini","text":"Wonderful work!! These shards will work nicely. Here you are then. I found a few flasks of treant resin in the back. You can have one. Thanks again. It kept me from having to go out and hunt treants."},{"npc":"Lumi Stergnon","text":"You have done well, my child. Let me add the touch of harmony to finish the job.. Here, then. Take these supplies. I am sure you'll need them. Soon you may be able to assist us in [important missions]."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-26T04:14:08.725Z","outOfEra":false}
