the ",{"title":"Faceted Hyacinth"},"."],"steps":[]}]},{"parts":["Turn in ",{"title":"White Gold Necklace"},", ",{"title":"Crystalline Orb"},", ",{"title":"Bloodied Piece of Parchment"},", ",{"title":"Faceted Hyacinth"}," to ",{"title":"Kazzel D`Leryt"}," and receive ",{"title":"Faceted Hyacinth Telesm"}],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Give ",{"title":"Faceted Hyacinth Telesm"}," to ",{"title":"Xenyari Lisariel"}," for ",{"title":"Pulsating Hyacinth Telesm"}],"steps":[]}]},{"parts":[{"title":"Spell: Life Leech"}],"steps":[{"parts":["Return the ",{"title":"Pulsating Hyacinth Telesm"}," to ",{"title":"Kazzel D`Leryt"}," to spawn ",{"title":"Monstrous zombie","label":"monstrous zombie"},"."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Kill ",{"title":"Monstrous zombie","label":"monstrous zombie"}," and loot ",{"title":"Monstrous Zombie Heart"}],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Give the ",{"title":"Monstrous Zombie Heart"}," to ",{"title":"Kazzel D`Leryt"}," for ",{"title":"Spell: Life Leech"},"."],"steps":[]}]}],"card":{"title":"The Etched Stone","lines":["Minimum Level: 46","Classes: Shadow Knight","Related Zones: Rathe Mountains, Lower Guk, Permafrost, Nagafen's Lair","Related NPCs: A froglok noble, Darfumpel Zirubbel, Xenyari Lisariel, monstrous zombie, an icy terror, stone spider"]},"links":["Rathe Mountains","Kazzel D`Leryt","Shadow Knight","Lower Guk","Permafrost","Nagafen's Lair","A froglok noble","Darfumpel Zirubbel","Xenyari Lisariel","Monstrous zombie","An icy terror","Stone spider","Pulsating Hyacinth Telesm","Spell: Life Leech","Life Leech","White Gold Necklace","Crystalline Orb","Bloodied Piece of Parchment","Prickly Pear","Faceted Hyacinth","Uncut Hyacinth","Faceted Hyacinth Telesm","Monstrous Zombie Heart","Karam Dragonforge","Lady Vox"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Kazzel D`Leryt","text":"Very well, Mazirian. Take this gem to a master jeweler and return it to me with the other three items."},{"npc":"Darfumpel Zirubbel","text":"I have not seen a gem such as this in quite some time! It was not since I dabbled in a bit of necro? Wait? What are you going to use this for? Never mind. I do not wish to know. Here, take your gem and leave!"},{"npc":"Xenyari Lisariel","text":"Prickly Pears! I just love Prickly Pears!! Thank you so much for getting these for me. I really, really appreciate your gift and I shall not... OWW!! I hate when I stick myself with the needles! Oh look, I am bleeding now! *Sigh*. Can you hold this note for a moment, please? My hands are full and I must clean up."},{"npc":"Kazzel D`Leryt","text":"You are quite cunning. After I fashion this telesm, take it back to Xenyari. She would 'enjoy' another 'gift,' eh?"},{"npc":"Kazzel D`Leryt","text":"Oh! Umm... Well, I was just playing with you. Certainly you know I was joking! We had a deal and I will abide by the terms of our agreement. Here is my payment for your services. Bye..."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-26T06:24:24.522Z","outOfEra":false}
