Gnoll Bounty	29	{"kind":"quest","title":"Gnoll Bounty","wikiPath":"/Gnoll_Bounty","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Halas","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Lysbith McNaff","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Iron Ration","item":"Iron Ration","wikiPath":"/Iron_Ration"},{"text":"Ration","item":"Ration","wikiPath":"/Ration"},{"text":"Torch","item":"Torch","wikiPath":"/Torch"},{"text":"Water Flask","item":"Water Flask","wikiPath":"/Water_Flask"}],"card":{"title":"Gnoll Bounty","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: All","Related Zones: Blackburrow, Everfrost Peaks","Related NPCs: a gnoll, a gnoll guardsman","Faction note: Available at Indifferent faction with Wolves of the North."]},"links":["Halas","Lysbith McNaff","Blackburrow","Everfrost Peaks","A gnoll","A gnoll guardsman","Iron Ration","Ration","Torch","Water Flask","Wolves of the North","Ice Goblin Necklaces","Gnoll Fang","Shamen of Justice","Merchants of Halas","Rogues of the White Rose","Steel Warriors"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Lysbith McNaff","text":"I've placed a bounty on the gnolls o' Blackburrow. Their whelps have invaded our land and we must carry the fight into their dens. Join the fight and return three gnoll fangs as proof of yer victory in Blackburrow. Do so, and earn the respect o' the Wolves o' the North."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-27T07:13:34.331Z","outOfEra":false}
